OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHealth warning issued as
OL,4,Aforecasters predict snow
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS leaders in the north-west of
OL,7,FEngland have urged people to take steps
OL,8,Fto protect their health as forecasters
OL,9,Fwarn of snow.
OL,11,FA yellow warning for wintry weather in
OL,12,FGreater Manchester and Lancashire came
OL,13,Finto force at midnight and will apply
OL,14,Funtil 11:00 GMT.
OL,16,FMeanwhile the UK Health Security Agency
OL,17,F(UKHSA) has issued a "yellow
OL,18,Fcold-health alert" covering three
OL,19,Fregions - the North West, North East
OL,20,Fand Yorkshire and the Humber - which
OL,21,Fwill be place until 09:00 on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
